WEBVTT

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:32.760
Now, I don't know about you guys,

00:13:32.784 --> 00:13:35.601
but judging the circumstances, right,

00:13:35.625 --> 00:13:37.916
any judge in the whole world,

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:40.404
would look at the statistics
and the evidence,

00:13:40.428 --> 00:13:43.713
and they would find any government
of old guilty of child abuse.

00:13:44.268 --> 00:13:45.372
That's my belief.

00:13:45.396 --> 00:13:48.396
(Applause)

00:13:52.287 --> 00:13:53.916
(Applause ends)

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:57.232
Now, if I came up here, and I wish
I could come up here today

00:13:57.256 --> 00:13:59.917
and hang a cure for AIDS or cancer,

00:13:59.941 --> 00:14:02.391
you'd be fighting
and scrambling to get to me.